# `use` switches exhaustively over dep's sealed interface S, with no default. Unsealing S changes
# no member, only drops the PermittedSubclasses attribute, yet makes the switch non-exhaustive.
> use/compile
$ sleep 2000
$ copy-file changes/S.java dep/src/main/java/S.java
-> use/compile
> use/clean
> dep/clean
-> use/compile
